":14,"x":765.93,"y":683.71,"cell":5477,"i":17,"name":"The Magical Tavern","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious pan-fried beans with white wine is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":570.71,"y":645.48,"cell":5108,"i":18,"name":"The Proud Inn","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious flame-broiled cake with purple nectar is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":403.98,"y":166.87,"cell":210,"i":19,"name":"The Dark Elk","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled boar with yellow rum is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":252.05,"y":610.89,"cell":4721,"i":20,"name":"The Major Tavern","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious stuffed pasta with fire brandy is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":854.73,"y":477.1,"cell":3365,"i":21,"name":"The Purple Shark","tags":[],"note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled catfish with bitter beer is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a8","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":303.06,"y":150.75,"cell":152,"i":22,"name":"Kobasaylian Lighthouse","tags":[],"note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a8","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":171.9,"y":505.11,"cell":3580,"i":23,"name":"Narithuan Lighthouse","tags":[],"note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":142.87,"y":271.51,"cell":992,"i":24,"name":"Turkornu Battlefield","tags":[],"note":"A historical battle of the Lindil-Shonan Invasion. \r\nDate: January 16, 600 Padstonby Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":368.26,"y":531.23,"cell":3922,"i":25,"name":"Yridhmorkald Battlefield","tags":[],"note":"A historical battle of the Yakalelian Crusade. \r\nDate: June 2, 852 Padstonby Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":578.24,"y":597.45,"cell":4665,"i":26,"name":"Bayantnorin Battlefield","tags":[],"note":"A historical battle of the Aymsean Conquest. \r\nDate: April 21, 1008 Padstonby Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":791.49,"y":394.08,"cell":2438,"i":27,"name":"Sharndrel Battlefield","tags":[],"note":"A historical battle of the Methinese Conflict. \r\nDate: September 21, 857 Padstonby Era."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":687.09,"y":462.1,"cell":3151,"i":28,"name":"Dungeon","tags":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=23151\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=23151\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":650.61,"y":523.64,"cell":3853,"i":29,"name":"Dungeon","tags":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=23853\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=23853\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":351.32,"y":442.81,"cell":2905,"i":30,"name":"Dungeon","tags":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=22905\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=22905\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":655.62,"y":419.16,"cell":2736,"i":31,"name":"Dungeon","tags":[],"note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=22736\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=22736\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f409","type":"lake-monsters","dy":48,"x":229.84,"y":299.68,"cell":1306,"i":32,"name":"Naram Monster","tags":[],"note":"Whispers say a relic monster of 14 m long inhabits Naram Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":433.67,"y":312.92,"cell":1451,"i":33,"name":"Alister Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 18 m long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":429.4,"y":293.9,"cell":1222,"i":34,"name":"Padstab Monster","tags":[],"note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 13 m long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":195.77,"y":367.62,"cell":2067,"i":35,"name":"Zaragz Banshee","tags":[],"note":"Locals speak of a horrifying Banshee who inhabits Zaragz hills and terrorizes the region."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":321.57,"y":632.7,"cell":4990,"i":36,"name":"Srath Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Serpents Forefathers."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":906.99,"y":233.74,"cell":727,"i":37,"name":"Aatornoste Forest","tags":[],"note":"A forest sacred to local Drakonic Beliefs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":619.3,"y":742.5,"cell":5776,"i":38,"name":"Hulaan Pinery","tags":[],"note":"A pinery sacred to local Human Ancestors."},{"icon":"glyph-1f334","type":"sacred-palm-groves","px":13,"x":97.7,"y":386.1,"cell":2257,"i":39,"name":"Doguzkayba Palm Grove","tags":[],"note":"A palm grove sacred to local Human Ancestors."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":436.5,"y":391.82,"cell":2396,"i":40,"name":"Shuled Sharks","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest bandits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":857.59,"y":434.59,"cell":2864,"i":41,"name":"Irethlebelsa Boars","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":803.12,"y":659.72,"cell":5319,"i":42,"name":"Tunel Crows","tags":[],"note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":539,"y":466.9,"cell":3233,"i":43,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":715.9,"y":723.8,"cell":5721,"i":44,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":752.55,"y":405.64,"cell":2536,"i":45,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":119.52,"y":214.02,"cell":517,"i":46,"name":"Pirates","tags":[],"note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":227.49,"y":263.61,"cell":922,"i":47,"name":"Uran Sculpture","tags":[],"note":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༠༚༮༦༠༳༨༤༇༘༤༁༽༁༌༢་་༸༉༅༜༓༡༕༊༦༆༩༂༔༐༔༳ༀ༶༛༘༜༂༉༺༆༐༵༿་༕༿༃༜༒༩ༀ༚༳༮༶༼༅༳༺༡༜༤༼༊༁༯༧༼༱༜༷༷</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":396.8,"y":191.3,"cell":366,"i":48,"name":"Lolthmyuethlet Effigy","tags":[],"note":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ሠጰዘወዘ ዐየወደ ወሀቀቀ ተ ሀፀ ወነሰሰ ወአ የመሐረዐሀዐሰአሰደከከአሰ ፈተረሠጰነዐፈሠጰ ፈነደገ ቀበዘበቀዐሐየረወፀወሀዘፐሐፈፐቀ ሐገኀመዐኀበ ዘሀአ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":944.74,"y":358.23,"cell":2048,"i":49,"name":"Jernetis Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⲶⲲⲴⳆⳘⳔⲸ⳾ⳞⳄⳤⲼ ⳹⳪⳪ⲼⳔⳆⳚⳃⳃⳄⳫⳐⳔⳤ⳥Ⲵ⳾ⲺⲺⳖ ⳂⲾ ⲺⳂⲾⳀⳲⳈⲴⳘⳲⳊⳆⳫⳈ </div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":660.58,"y":425.88,"cell":2737,"i":50,"name":"Ruined Town","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":603.1,"y":255.6,"cell":885,"i":51,"name":"Ruined Fortress","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":253.07,"y":520.69,"cell":3806,"i":52,"name":"Ruined Mausoleum","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient mausoleum. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":833.9,"y":656.02,"cell":5232,"i":53,"name":"Ruined City","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":411.99,"y":208.28,"cell":430,"i":54,"name":"Szithalkhyn Library","tags":[],"note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":744.52,"y":544.53,"cell":4073,"i":55,"name":"Travelling Magical Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":519.72,"y":676.44,"cell":5371,"i":56,"name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":383.85,"y":668.71,"cell":5262,"i":57,"name":"Bagaan Competition","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a competition of speed in Bagaan, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":747.39,"y":316.37,"cell":1606,"i":58,"name":"Paartharylaug Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Paartharylaug, offering local bronze, artillery, and ceramics alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":828.65,"y":404.16,"cell":2544,"i":59,"name":"Minor Jetty","tags":[],"note":"A small location along the Nelonaladas Fork to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":910.69,"y":239.45,"cell":729,"i":60,"name":"Ibises migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of ibises are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":214.76,"y":410.9,"cell":2577,"i":61,"name":"Entrancing mirage","tags":[],"note":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":898.33,"y":350.6,"cell":1942,"i":62,"name":"Bleuristhaly Cave","tags":[],"note":"The Bleuristhaly Cave. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":489.59,"y":590.46,"cell":4560,"i":63,"name":"Khishaant Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":487.83,"y":644.42,"cell":5101,"i":64,"name":"Khovd Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":444.82,"y":656.47,"cell":5188,"i":65,"name":"Bugat Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":765.92,"y":697.41,"cell":5619,"i":66,"name":"Khagaandal Portal","tags":[],"note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":258.8,"y":228.2,"cell":609,"i":67,"nam